#: 1fc8765bf52b422eaeeec864e9b0025a
msgid ""
"After setting :ref:`RSSI_TYPE<RSSI_TYPE>` to a value other than 0 you will "
"have to save and refresh your parameters to uncollapse a set of subordinate "
"parameters that allow to further specify RSSI handling."
msgstr ""
"将 :ref:`RSSI_TYPE<RSSI_TYPE>` 设置为非0值后，需要保存并刷新参数，以展开一组从属参数，用于进一步指定RSSI处理方式。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-rssi-received-signal-strength-indication.rst:40
#: 763f86fcf22f43e6a560cc8d6806f724
msgid "There are four basic options for feeding RSSI to your autopilot:"
msgstr "向飞控传递RSSI有四种基本方式："

#: ../../source/docs/common-rssi-received-signal-strength-indication.rst:48
#: da42ac3876a74796b6e3aa02c894b543
msgid ""
":ref:`RSSI_TYPE<RSSI_TYPE>` = 1  Analog voltage type RSSI fed to a dedicated"
" pin"
msgstr ":ref:`RSSI_TYPE<RSSI_TYPE>` = 1  模拟电压型RSSI接入专用引脚"

#: ../../source/docs/common-rssi-received-signal-strength-indication.rst:43
#: 5844618ad59646ac838d3e219ef54c2a
msgid ""
":ref:`RSSI_ANA_PIN<RSSI_ANA_PIN>`  specifies the pin used to read RSSI "
"voltage. This parameter defaults to the correct pin number on most boards "
"when using current chibios firmware."
msgstr ""
":ref:`RSSI_ANA_PIN<RSSI_ANA_PIN>` "
"指定用于读取RSSI电压的引脚。使用当前ChibiOS固件时，该参数在大多数飞控板上默认设置为正确的引脚编号。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-rssi-received-signal-strength-indication.rst:45
#: eb3fc081d33d4babad28259552221645
msgid ""
":ref:`RSSI_PIN_HIGH<RSSI_PIN_HIGH>`  voltage received on the "
":ref:`RSSI_ANA_PIN<RSSI_ANA_PIN>` when the signal is the strongest."
msgstr ""
":ref:`RSSI_PIN_HIGH<RSSI_PIN_HIGH>` 信号最强时 :ref:`RSSI_ANA_PIN<RSSI_ANA_PIN>` "
"上接收到的电压。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-rssi-received-signal-strength-indication.rst:47
#: 424035b4e1d64509b8dd7be761c46b80
msgid ""
":ref:`RSSI_PIN_LOW<RSSI_PIN_LOW>`  voltage received on the "
":ref:`RSSI_ANA_PIN<RSSI_ANA_PIN>` when the signal is the weakest."
msgstr ""
":ref:`RSSI_PIN_LOW<RSSI_PIN_LOW>` 信号最弱时 :ref:`RSSI_ANA_PIN<RSSI_ANA_PIN>` "
"上接收到的电压。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-rssi-received-signal-strength-indication.rst:56
#: 01d0ebf6b0f841caa551cb81230bb5eb
msgid ""
":ref:`RSSI_TYPE<RSSI_TYPE>` = 2  PWM Channel type RSSI embedded in a "
"collective PPM / sum signal (sBus)"
msgstr ":ref:`RSSI_TYPE<RSSI_TYPE>` = 2  嵌入集合PPM/求和信号（sBus）的PWM通道型RSSI"

#: ../../source/docs/common-rssi-received-signal-strength-indication.rst:51
#: bd97bce4297b45e6829d00243ebdf57a
msgid ""
":ref:`RSSI_CHANNEL<RSSI_CHANNEL>`  Channel number the radio receiver will "
"use to embed RSSI if collective / sum signal is used (channel 5 and up)."
msgstr ""
":ref:`RSSI_CHANNEL<RSSI_CHANNEL>` 使用集合/求和信号时，RC接收机用于嵌入RSSI的通道编号（第5通道及以上）。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-rssi-received-signal-strength-indication.rst:53
#: ../../source/docs/common-rssi-received-signal-strength-indication.rst:65
#: dd0ac5211777440fb8a9f3ec054b8c6d fcf7f764e0eb4af4b2ecc91805b2feba
msgid ""
":ref:`RSSI_CHAN_HIGH<RSSI_CHAN_HIGH>`  PWM value the radio receiver will "
"output when the signal is the strongest."
msgstr ":ref:`RSSI_CHAN_HIGH<RSSI_CHAN_HIGH>` 信号最强时RC接收机输出的PWM值。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-rssi-received-signal-strength-indication.rst:55
#: ../../source/docs/common-rssi-received-signal-strength-indication.rst:67
#: 2c77072ac67b4d688260cad7fed55443 f8d75e2d57504f15b8227075f9f2873e
msgid ""
":ref:`RSSI_CHAN_LOW<RSSI_CHAN_LOW>`  PWM value the radio receiver will "
"output when the signal is the weakest."
msgstr ":ref:`RSSI_CHAN_LOW<RSSI_CHAN_LOW>` 信号最弱时RC接收机输出的PWM值。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-rssi-received-signal-strength-indication.rst:58
#: 32fc9a0fc9b343d190af8e2816a2b233
msgid ""
":ref:`RSSI_TYPE<RSSI_TYPE>` = 3  digital receiver protocols' signal quality "
"or dropped packets information (SUMD / ST24 /FPort) Scaled internally, no "
"further adjustments required."
msgstr ""
":ref:`RSSI_TYPE<RSSI_TYPE>` = 3  数字接收机协议的信号质量或丢包信息（SUMD / ST24 / "
"FPort），内部自动缩放，无需进一步调整。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-rssi-received-signal-strength-indication.rst:68
#: 11ceaffd79614b469601629816b10094
msgid ""
":ref:`RSSI_TYPE<RSSI_TYPE>` = 4  PWM type RSSI fed to a dedicated GPIO pin"
msgstr ":ref:`RSSI_TYPE<RSSI_TYPE>` = 4  PWM型RSSI接入专用GPIO引脚"

#: ../../source/docs/common-rssi-received-signal-strength-indication.rst:63
#: 71257f6738d9441eabcbe28d881d79aa
msgid ""
":ref:`RSSI_ANA_PIN<RSSI_ANA_PIN>`  Specifies the GPIO pin to read PWM type "
"RSSI from. On boards with IOMCU these are the AUX pins that can be used as "
"PWM output by default or alternatively set to be used as GPIO . See "
":ref:`common-gpios`."
msgstr ""
":ref:`RSSI_ANA_PIN<RSSI_ANA_PIN>` "
"指定用于读取PWM型RSSI的GPIO引脚。在带IOMCU的飞控板上，这些是默认可用作PWM输出或可选设置为GPIO的AUX引脚。参见 "
":ref:`common-gpios`。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-rssi-received-signal-strength-indication.rst:71
#: dc8daadb61564452a789e1ffb78eaef2
msgid ""
"Some radio receivers output inverted RSSI values (lowest voltage / PWM on "
"best reception), so _HIGH parameters may actually be set to lower values "
"than corresponding _LOW parameters for correct internal scaling to 0 - 100%."
msgstr ""
"某些RC接收机输出反转的RSSI值（信号最好时电压/PWM最低），因此_HIGH参数的实际值可能低于对应的_LOW参数，以实现正确的内部0 - "
"100%缩放。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-rssi-received-signal-strength-indication.rst:75
#: 79990dee6a234da7acf2c0dc4a9ed34a
msgid ""
"To read analog voltage type RSSI,  :ref:`RSSI_ANA_PIN<RSSI_ANA_PIN>`  can be"
" set to any free ADC pin available. On pixhawk / cube type boards, this "
"includes the sBus out / RSSI input pin (103). When using dedicated ADC pins,"
" the corresponding pin number usually matches the ADC1 channel used on that "
"pin. See the DMA1 map in the `resepective processor's alternative function "
"table "
"<https://github.com/ArduPilot/ardupilot/tree/master/libraries/AP_HAL_ChibiOS/hwdef/scripts>`__"
" for further reference."
msgstr ""
"若要读取模拟电压型RSSI，:ref:`RSSI_ANA_PIN<RSSI_ANA_PIN>` "
"可设置为任意空闲的ADC引脚。在Pixhawk/Cube类型飞控板上，这包括sBus输出/RSSI输入引脚（103）。使用专用ADC引脚时，对应的引脚编号通常与该引脚上使用的ADC1通道号相匹配。更多参考信息请参阅"
" `相应处理器的替代功能表 "
"<https://github.com/ArduPilot/ardupilot/tree/master/libraries/AP_HAL_ChibiOS/hwdef/scripts>`__"
" 中的DMA1映射。"

