#: ../../source/docs/common-rssi-received-signal-strength-indication.rst:106
#: 509088bde19c4f88b108ea9079135d49
msgid "RSSI embedded in a collective PPM / sum signal's channel"
msgstr "RSSI嵌入集合PPM/求和信号通道"

#: ../../source/docs/common-rssi-received-signal-strength-indication.rst:108
#: 7b5584ba099445f59f8310c4c6ff034d
msgid ""
"It is common practice to feed all RC channels from your RC receiver to your "
"autopilot using a cPPM or sBus type sum signal on a single signal wire. Most"
" UHF type RC systems like EZUHF, OpenLRS, Crossfire or DragonLink support "
"embedding RSSI into a dedicated channel within this collective / sum signal "
"stream. As per ArduPilot default channels 1-4 are used as input for primary "
"control (roll, pitch, throttle, yaw), any channel number above 4 can be used"
" to embed RSSI. Usually, these systems use a GUI to assign RSSI to a "
"dedicated channel slot on your RC receiver, or have it set to a standard "
"channel by default. See your respective system's user manual for reference."
msgstr ""
"通常通过cPPM或sBus类型的求和信号在单根信号线上将所有RC通道从RC接收机传送到飞控。大多数UHF型RC系统（如EZUHF、OpenLRS、Crossfire或DragonLink）支持将RSSI嵌入该集合/求和信号流中的专用通道。根据ArduPilot默认设置，1-4通道用于主控输入（横滚、俯仰、油门、偏航），4以上的任意通道均可用于嵌入RSSI。通常，这些系统使用图形界面将RSSI分配到RC接收机上的专用通道槽，或默认设置为标准通道。具体说明请参阅相应系统的用户手册。"

