msgstr "以下示例展示如何在DragonLink RC接收机上将通道5分配为嵌入RSSI："

#: ../../source/docs/common-rssi-received-signal-strength-indication.rst:120
#: 77dddff79fb5456e8c9c379886911104
msgid ""
"RSSI values will be output both within the PPM stream on signal pin 1 as "
"well as within the sBus stream on pin 4. Either can be fed to your "
"autopilot's RCInput pin."
msgstr "RSSI值将同时通过信号引脚1上的PPM流和引脚4上的sBus流输出。任一输出均可接入飞控的RCInput引脚。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-rssi-received-signal-strength-indication.rst:122
