"pin)"
msgstr ":ref:`RSSI_ANA_PIN<RSSI_ANA_PIN>` = 103（PixHawk SBUS输出/RSSI输入引脚）"

#: ../../source/docs/common-rssi-received-signal-strength-indication.rst:166
#: 292291c8e0a24f82b45326ebf1d0d17d
msgid ""
":ref:`RSSI_PIN_HIGH<RSSI_PIN_HIGH>`  voltage received on the "
":ref:`RSSI_ANA_PIN<RSSI_ANA_PIN>` when the signal is the strongest, usually "
"3,3V."
