":ref:`RSSI_PIN_HIGH<RSSI_PIN_HIGH>` 信号最强时 :ref:`RSSI_ANA_PIN<RSSI_ANA_PIN>` "
"上接收到的电压，通常为3.3V。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-rssi-received-signal-strength-indication.rst:168
#: 630fab538f1b45b89d0d7fe7f22fcc14
msgid ""
":ref:`RSSI_PIN_LOW<RSSI_PIN_LOW>`  voltage received on the "
":ref:`RSSI_ANA_PIN<RSSI_ANA_PIN>` when the signal is the weakest, usually 0V"
msgstr ""
":ref:`RSSI_PIN_LOW<RSSI_PIN_LOW>` 信号最弱时 :ref:`RSSI_ANA_PIN<RSSI_ANA_PIN>` "
"上接收到的电压，通常为0V。"

