#: ../../source/docs/common-rssi-received-signal-strength-indication.rst:233
#: e0c1549e1f164c068ebbf9f95b885bdc
msgid ""
"How to utilize Futaba S.BUS2 \"Frame Error Rate\" information to be used as "
"RSSI in your autopilot"
msgstr "如何利用Futaba S.BUS2「帧错误率」信息在飞控中用作RSSI"

#: ../../source/docs/common-rssi-received-signal-strength-indication.rst:235
#: 32d60ecff49d408eb4601e7a5e90a59c
msgid ""
"The **Frame Error Rate (FER)** indicates, if the receiver has trouble "
"decoding a received data package sent by the transmitter. The value is "
"similar to RSSI."
msgstr "**帧错误率（FER）** 表示接收机解码发射机发送的数据包时是否遇到问题。该值类似于RSSI。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-rssi-received-signal-strength-indication.rst:237
#: 39a48fb47f2e4fe9a01275cde8875718
#, no-python-format
msgid ""
"The FER information is implemented within the **Futaba S.BUS2** datastream. "
"It is not transmitted as a continuous value, but is sent in 25% resolution."
msgstr "FER信息在 **Futaba S.BUS2** 数据流中实现。它不是以连续值传输，而是以25%的分辨率发送。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-rssi-received-signal-strength-indication.rst:240
