#: ../../source/docs/common-rssi-received-signal-strength-indication.rst:249
#: 52ff4a1f4db84fef86a1261eb6c5448c
msgid ""
"To enable **S.Bus and S.Bus2 protocol** on your Futaba receiver, you have to"
" set your **R7008SB** receiver to **\"Mode B\"** or **\"Mode C\"** and your "
"**R7003SB** receiver to **\"Mode A\"**. Check out your `R7008SB "
"<http://manuals.hobbico.com/fut/r7008sb-manual.pdf>`__ or `R7003SB "
"<http://manuals.hobbico.com/fut/r7003sb-manual.pdf>`__  user manual for "
"further details."
msgstr ""
"要在Futaba接收机上启用 **S.Bus和S.Bus2协议**，需要将 **R7008SB** 接收机设置为 **「Mode B」** 或 "
"**「Mode C」**，将 **R7003SB** 接收机设置为 **「Mode A」**。详情请参阅 `R7008SB "
"<http://manuals.hobbico.com/fut/r7008sb-manual.pdf>`__ 或 `R7003SB "
"<http://manuals.hobbico.com/fut/r7003sb-manual.pdf>`__ 用户手册。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-rssi-received-signal-strength-indication.rst:258
#: 790bc5d29ba64182bc1d1a662da62cba
#, no-python-format
msgid ""
"The converter is designed to provide a max. voltage output of 3.3 V DC when "
"100% of the frames are good, and appr. 0.4 V DC when connection is lost or "
"receiver is in failsafe. To get best results, it is best practice to "
"calibrate the output voltages of the converter at \"full reception\" and "
"\"Tx off\" using a voltmeter. In general the converter should output the "
"following DC voltage:"
msgstr ""
"转换器设计为在100%帧正常时最大输出3.3V直流电压，连接断开或接收机处于失控保护状态时输出约0.4V直流电压。为获得最佳效果，建议在「满信号」和「关闭遥控器」状态下用电压表对转换器的输出电压进行校准。一般情况下，转换器应输出以下直流电压："

#: ../../source/docs/common-rssi-received-signal-strength-indication.rst:260
#: 6310380ade7f418ba8b7534cecb7f08f
#, no-python-format
msgid "**Rx in failsafe** --> 12 % of max. **VDC out ~ 0.4 V DC**"
msgstr "**接收机处于失控保护** --> 最大值的12%，**直流输出约0.4V**"

#: ../../source/docs/common-rssi-received-signal-strength-indication.rst:261
#: 093469a619ee4e15b1c8c291e120fe88
#, no-python-format
msgid "Rx received <= 25 % good frames --> 34 % of max. VDC out ~ 1.1 V DC"
msgstr "接收机收到 <= 25% 好帧 --> 最大值的34%，直流输出约1.1V"

#: ../../source/docs/common-rssi-received-signal-strength-indication.rst:262
#: e0d9f656f53b44df98e7982d2821bc5b
#, no-python-format
msgid "Rx received <= 50 % good frames --> 56 % of max. VDC out ~ 1.85 V DC"
msgstr "接收机收到 <= 50% 好帧 --> 最大值的56%，直流输出约1.85V"

#: ../../source/docs/common-rssi-received-signal-strength-indication.rst:263
#: 3275946dc744453cb395264d7a65c7e8
#, no-python-format
msgid "Rx received <= 75 % good frames --> 78 % of max. VDC out ~ 2.6 V DC"
msgstr "接收机收到 <= 75% 好帧 --> 最大值的78%，直流输出约2.6V"

#: ../../source/docs/common-rssi-received-signal-strength-indication.rst:264
#: e576f69b601c490392bbe09c715d5426
#, no-python-format
msgid ""
"**Rx received <= 100 % good frames** --> 100 % of max. **VDC out ~ 3.3 V "
"DC**"
msgstr "**接收机收到 <= 100% 好帧** --> 最大值的100%，**直流输出约3.3V**"

#: ../../source/docs/common-rssi-received-signal-strength-indication.rst:267
#: 728d75742c7b43d59f25a81136436854
msgid ""
"How to setup RSSI Feedback to your Futaba FASSTest Telemetry capable "
"transmitter"
msgstr "如何为Futaba FASSTest数传兼容遥控器设置RSSI反馈"

#: ../../source/docs/common-rssi-received-signal-strength-indication.rst:269
#: 8d0669cd93c24a52b56852e4f2619559
msgid ""
"In addition to the S.BUS2 to Analog conversion, the `converter "
"<http://shop.tje.dk/catalog/product_info.php?products_id=43>`__  is looping "
"back the FER / RSSI value to the S.BUS2 datastream simultaniously. This "
"feature enables all users of **FASSTest Telemetry capable transmitters** to "
"setup a **Telemetry RSSI Feedback** as an option. Moreover an **audible "
"and/or vibration alarm** can be set to notice when received signal quality "
"is degrading."
msgstr ""
"除S.BUS2转模拟转换外，`转换器 "
"<http://shop.tje.dk/catalog/product_info.php?products_id=43>`__ "
"还同时将FER/RSSI值回传至S.BUS2数据流。该功能使所有 **FASSTest数传兼容遥控器** 用户可将 **数传RSSI反馈** "
"设置为选项。此外，还可设置 **声音和/或震动报警** 以在接收信号质量下降时提醒用户。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-rssi-received-signal-strength-indication.rst:271
