"In case you changed the protocol, eventualy you have to re \"LINK\" your "
"receiver to your transmitter [4]."
msgstr "如果更改了协议，可能需要重新将接收机与遥控器「LINK」绑定[4]。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-rssi-received-signal-strength-indication.rst:278
#: d9b032ff11ba48bc904144f0714f0424
msgid "Ensure, that TELEMETRY is set to \"ACT\" [5]."
msgstr "确保遥控设置（TELEMETRY）已设置为「ACT」[5]。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-rssi-received-signal-strength-indication.rst:283
#: f57f5563da944b41bdbe3c263baf88a3
#, no-python-format
msgid ""
"Due to the fact that Futabas Telemetry Sensors can't be renamed, the "
"transmitted FER / RSSI value appears as a simple **\"temperature sensor\"**,"
" wheras \"0°C\" means \"Rx in failsafe\" and \"100°C\" means \"Rx received "
"<= 100 % good frames\"."
msgstr ""
"由于Futaba数传传感器无法重命名，传输的FER/RSSI值将以简单的 **「温度传感器」** "
"形式显示，其中「0°C」表示「接收机处于失控保护」，「100°C」表示「接收机收到 <= 100% 好帧」。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-rssi-received-signal-strength-indication.rst:285
#: b1d5768161824091bc4cadc4af0b436a
msgid ""
"The `converter "
"<http://shop.tje.dk/catalog/product_info.php?products_id=43>`__ is reporting"
" the current FER / RSSI value into Slot 1 of S.Bus2 Telemetry datastream."
msgstr ""
"`转换器 <http://shop.tje.dk/catalog/product_info.php?products_id=43>`__ "
"将当前FER/RSSI值上报至S.Bus2数传数据流的槽位1。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-rssi-received-signal-strength-indication.rst:292
#: 1422c47a599445cb852716606dbf67e7
msgid ""
"In order to decode the FER / RSSI feedback of the converter, a standard "
"\"TEMP125\" Sensor has to be assigned to Slot 1 of your transmitter:"
msgstr "为解码转换器的FER/RSSI反馈，需要将标准「TEMP125」传感器分配到遥控器的槽位1："

#: ../../source/docs/common-rssi-received-signal-strength-indication.rst:288
#: c9c35c7d817c41768ff57bb910349e39
msgid "Enter the \"LINKAGE MENU\" by double clicking the \"LNK\" button."
msgstr "双击「LNK」按钮进入「LINKAGE MENU」。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-rssi-received-signal-strength-indication.rst:289
#: d8c186e8808b4030a7266714d19be2a8
msgid ""
"Show page 2 of the menu by pressing \"S1\" [1], goto \"SENSOR\" and press "
"\"RTN\" [2]."
msgstr "按「S1」[1]切换到菜单第2页，前往「SENSOR」并按「RTN」[2]。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-rssi-received-signal-strength-indication.rst:290
#: 6f2d3d03e8ac453eaec9d1abc10a1ac0
msgid "Goto Slot 1 tab and press \"RTN\" [3]."
msgstr "前往槽位1标签并按「RTN」[3]。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-rssi-received-signal-strength-indication.rst:291
#: 3154b23952ff4ff9ad1733d1d668c0b5
msgid ""
"Choose \"TEMP125\" Sensor and confirm the selection by pressing \"RTN\" two "
"times [4]."
msgstr "选择「TEMP125」传感器并按「RTN」两次确认选择[4]。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-rssi-received-signal-strength-indication.rst:292
#: 5804900b4ed34e26806005a3996d18e1
msgid ""
"Slot 1 should be assigned with a \"TEMP125\" Sensor now [5]. If so, leave "
"the menu by pressing \"HOME/EXIT\" button two times."
msgstr "槽位1现在应已分配「TEMP125」传感器[5]。如果是，则按两次「HOME/EXIT」按钮退出菜单。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-rssi-received-signal-strength-indication.rst:305
#: 343af4938a3d49f3ba8440a713979d34
msgid ""
"To display the FER / RSSI value and to trigger an alarm, your TELEMETRY "
"MONITOR has to be configured:"
msgstr "要显示FER/RSSI值并触发报警，需要配置数传监视器（TELEMETRY MONITOR）："

#: ../../source/docs/common-rssi-received-signal-strength-indication.rst:298
#: 3c7509aaf22c4e9daf34d25be24ab8c2
msgid "Enter the \"TELEM.MONI\" menu by pressing the \"HOME/EXIT\" button [1]."
msgstr "按「HOME/EXIT」按钮[1]进入「TELEM.MONI」菜单。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-rssi-received-signal-strength-indication.rst:299
#: f1c29b6aad764cc7ba993226fbc71126
msgid "Goto \"RECEIVER\" and press the \"RTN\" button [2]."
msgstr "前往「RECEIVER」并按「RTN」按钮[2]。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-rssi-received-signal-strength-indication.rst:300
#: 623af6b4220e4bf0b38b875226e783f5
msgid "Goto DISPLAY tab [3] and choose \"3\" [4]."
msgstr "前往DISPLAY标签[3]并选择「3」[4]。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-rssi-received-signal-strength-indication.rst:301
#: 819c36ef597d4f2abbe36b64814eb0aa
msgid "Goto \"SENSOR\" [5] and choose \"TEMP125\" [6] and confirm with \"RTN\"."
msgstr "前往「SENSOR」[5]，选择「TEMP125」[6]并按「RTN」确认。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-rssi-received-signal-strength-indication.rst:302
#: 7eba28cf01f6480e93363957cc7cd765
msgid ""
"Press \"HOME/EXIT\" to return to \"TELEM.MONI\" display and to see the RSSI "
"/ FER value as a \"Temperature\" [7]."
msgstr "按「HOME/EXIT」返回「TELEM.MONI」显示界面，以「Temperature」（温度）形式查看RSSI/FER值[7]。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-rssi-received-signal-strength-indication.rst:303
#: 31615b76d35d40dda743391ecc4eb0ec
msgid ""
"To set alarms, goto \"TEMP\" [7] and press \"RTN\". For alarm setup please "
"refer to your Tx user manual."
msgstr "如需设置报警，前往「TEMP」[7]并按「RTN」。报警设置请参阅遥控器用户手册。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-rssi-received-signal-strength-indication.rst:304
#: a80c67012b324862ab9110f6caba0121
msgid ""
"As soon as you connect your receiver with power, the FER / RSSI value will "
"show up as well as the standard received signal quality indicator [8]."
msgstr "一旦接收机通电连接，FER/RSSI值将与标准接收信号质量指示[8]一起显示。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-rssi-received-signal-strength-indication.rst:305
#: 3016b28f36c94545b29c026e0a5a3c2d
msgid ""
"The converter can be mixed with other telemetry devices as long as they are "
"assigned to Slot 2 to Slot 31 [9]."
msgstr "只要其他数传设备分配在槽位2至槽位31[9]，转换器可与这些设备混用。"

